{"capturado_en": "2026-11-17T18:38:56+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Collage Atlas", "steam_appid": 2581960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [2625570, 2864250], "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581960/extras/227fa37ec6b03dee0e07209e0e2c558e.webp?t=1716388254\" width=617 height=57 /></span><br><br><strong>Drawn entirely by one person over the course of 4.5 years.</strong><br><br><u><strong>The Collage Atlas</strong></u> invites you on a journey through an entirely hand-drawn picture-book dream-world.<br>From the grass beneath your feet, to the butterflies dancing in the air, to the floating islands drifting overhead - every little detail has been lovingly-crafted with pen &amp; ink on paper.<br>The result is a world the likes of which you’ve never seen before…<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581960/extras/8079c8e803368938acf456be06d9cac3.webp?t=1716388254\" width=617 height=57 /></span><br><br>Your presence matters, your gaze matters, your movements matter.<br>With all these things you breath life into the world.<br>Through your efforts, forests will grow, flowers will bloom, structures will rise…and airships will fly.<br>Shape the soundtrack as you travel - your every move causes the soundscape to ebb and flow.<br><strong>At its heart this is a journey exploring agency, memory, and hope.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>■ Features</strong></h2><br>- Dozens of secrets are tucked away in all corners of the world, waiting to be discovered.<br>- A dynamic soundtrack that responds to your play<br>- Featuring vocals by <strong><u>Frankie Rose </u></strong><br>- Includes an original illustrated book by John William Evelyn<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Please note - this is a short, focused experience.</strong></h2>Depending on your play-style you can play through in <u>1.5-2.5hrs.</u> Allow more time if you intend to seek out all the secrets, <br><strong>The Collage Atlas has been designed as a world I hope you will want to revisit.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581960/extras/f3b3c269ef935c460ef10da7cdcf9906.avif?t=1716388254\" width=616 height=324 /></span>", "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581960/extras/227fa37ec6b03dee0e07209e0e2c558e.webp?t=1716388254\" width=617 height=57 /></span><br><br><strong>Drawn entirely by one person over the course of 4.5 years.</strong><br><br><u><strong>The Collage Atlas</strong></u> invites you on a journey through an entirely hand-drawn picture-book dream-world.<br>From the grass beneath your feet, to the butterflies dancing in the air, to the floating islands drifting overhead - every little detail has been lovingly-crafted with pen &amp; ink on paper.<br>The result is a world the likes of which you’ve never seen before…<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581960/extras/8079c8e803368938acf456be06d9cac3.webp?t=1716388254\" width=617 height=57 /></span><br><br>Your presence matters, your gaze matters, your movements matter.<br>With all these things you breath life into the world.<br>Through your efforts, forests will grow, flowers will bloom, structures will rise…and airships will fly.<br>Shape the soundtrack as you travel - your every move causes the soundscape to ebb and flow.<br><strong>At its heart this is a journey exploring agency, memory, and hope.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>■ Features</strong></h2><br>- Dozens of secrets are tucked away in all corners of the world, waiting to be discovered.<br>- A dynamic soundtrack that responds to your play<br>- Featuring vocals by <strong><u>Frankie Rose </u></strong><br>- Includes an original illustrated book by John William Evelyn<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Please note - this is a short, focused experience.</strong></h2>Depending on your play-style you can play through in <u>1.5-2.5hrs.</u> Allow more time if you intend to seek out all the secrets, <br><strong>The Collage Atlas has been designed as a world I hope you will want to revisit.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581960/extras/f3b3c269ef935c460ef10da7cdcf9906.avif?t=1716388254\" width=616 height=324 /></span>", "short_description": "Lovingly crafted with pen &amp; ink, by one person over 4.5 years. In The Collage Atlas your presence, your gaze, your movements all matter. With these things you breathe life into this hand-drawn picture-book dream-world.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Dutch, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Turkish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581960/header.jpg?t=1716388254", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581960/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1716388254", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581960/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1716388254", "website": "http://thecollageatlas.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.8ghz Processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DX10 Video card with 512MB of VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</str